<title>JAPAN: Fuji Television says may seek listing on TSE.</title>
<headline>Fuji Television says may seek listing on TSE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fuji Television Network Inc may apply in March to list its shares on the Tokyo Stock Exchange's (TSE) first section, company president Hisashi Hie was quoted as saying by a Fuji spokesman on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The nationwide broadcaster is a unit of Nippon Broadcasting System Inc, which listed its shares on the TSE's second section in December 1996.</p>
</text>
